\uc0\u55358 \u56800  1. Why You\'92re Using ACI Now\
\
When you run the container in Azure Container Instance (ACI), it\'92s a standalone REST service.\
You can easily connect from:\
\
A Node.js or HTML/JS web page using REST / WebSocket.\
\
Your Python test client.\
