This setup is perfect for prototyping:\
\uc0\u9989  Simple \'96 one container with a public IP\
\uc0\u9989  Secure \'96 behind Azure infrastructure\
\uc0\u9989  No IoT Hub complexity\
\uc0\u9989  Ideal for quick testing from your Mac\
