Why/When You\'92d Use Azure IoT Hub + IoT Edge\
Scenario	Why IoT Hub + Edge\
\uc0\u55356 \u57325  NACD runs cameras in hospitals / campuses	Keep video on-prem \'97 process locally and send only metadata\
\uc0\u55357 \u56566  Sites may lose internet	Edge runs offline \u8594  syncs later\
\uc0\u55357 \u56594  Compliance / privacy	Video never leaves your building\
\uc0\u9881 \u65039  Multi-camera deployments	Each site = Edge device, IoT Hub centralizes events\
\
In short:\
\
Use ACI for testing / cloud demo.\
\
Use IoT Hub + Edge for production / real cameras on-prem.\
